  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "圖論",
    "sub_ename": "GRAPH THEORY",
    "describe_ch": "說明圖論之基本知識及相關應用問題之解題技巧. 先介紹基本觀念, 接著有圖之聯通性, 樹狀結構, 平面圖,\n圖之著色. 重點在於這些離散型的數學是如何使用於演算法的分析及設計.",
    "describe_eh": "As an introduction to the graph theory, topics include elementary graphs, connectivity and traversability of graphs, matching, trees, graph colorings and planar graphs.\nApplications of these discrete mathematics to the design and analysis of computer algorithms will be explained and implemented by real-life examples.",
